---
import { BadgeCheck, Flame } from "lucide-react";
---
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 rounded-xl border border-brand-200 bg-brand-50/60 px-4 py-3 text-sm">
  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink-700">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-brand-600 text-white text-[11px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 leading-none"><BadgeCheck className="w-3 h-3" /> Selección Micifú</span>
    = analizada y recomendada por calidad
  </span>
  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink-700">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 text-[11px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 leading-none"><Flame className="w-3 h-3" /> Superventas</span>
    = de las más vendidas (popularidad)
  </span>
</div>
